"Currently the following fields are added: \\i\\\\\n"
"\"info_min_time\"    - the earliest time bound for the search \\i\\\\\n"
"\"info_max_time\"    - the latest time bound for the search \\i\\\\\n"
"\"info_search_id\"   - query id of the search that generated the event "
"\\i\\\\\n"
"\"info_search_time\" - time when the search was executed."
