"like 'search' mode, with the exception that it strips the \\\n"
"hierarchical names from the fields in the results. For example, \\\n"
"the 'search' mode result 'dmObject.fieldname' is output simply \\\n"
"as 'fieldname' when the same search is run in 'flat' mode. The \\\n"
"'acceleration_search' mode runs the same search that is \\\n"
"executed when the data model is accelerated. The \\\n"
"acceleration_search' mode only works on root event objects and \\\n"
